.TH CODE2TXT 1 "2026" "code2pdf" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
code2txt \- combine source files into one Markdown text file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B code2txt
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIDIR\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B code2txt
writes every selected file under
.I DIR
(default: the current directory) into one Markdown file with a table of contents and
fenced code blocks, for use as LLM context.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-o, \-\-output " FILE
Output file (default
.IR combined.txt ).
.TP
.BI \-\-include\-types " LIST"
Only include these comma-separated extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-types " LIST"
Skip these extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-folders " LIST"
Skip these folder names.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-files " LIST"
Skip these file names.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-file\-size " SIZE"
Skip larger files, e.g. 500K or 1M (default 500K).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-toc
No table of contents.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Show processing details.
.TP
.B "\-V, \-\-version"
Show the version and how it is installed.
.TP
.B "\-h, \-\-help"
Show help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR code2pdf (1)
